# tools/api-parity captures BYTE-EXACT HTTP response baselines (see README.md).
# Same rationale as tools/parity (repo-root .gitattributes): with core.autocrlf=true a
# plain checkout converts LF to CRLF and would make the byte-level diff fail spuriously.
# -text => no EOL conversion; store and check out the exact bytes we captured.
reference/** -text
corpus/** -text
# The no-op engine stub is a committed BINARY (see assets/keyflux_stub.c): EOL
# conversion must never touch it, and the .c source is compared in review diffs.
assets/** -text
